id: pm-beads-jyil
title: Reject quoted heredoc operator text
description: "Fix Greptile PR 88 finding 3890108579: operator-looking characters inside a mixed quoted shell word open a synthetic heredoc."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-30T17:59:27.668Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-30T18:04:26.597Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-30T18:04:26.169Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-30T18:04:26.169Z"
author: pi-agent
severity: high
repro_steps: "echo x'<<EOF' followed by CMD=\"npm publish\" suppresses scalar indexing."
resolution: Retain quote provenance privately per token and accept heredoc operators only when both operator characters were unquoted.
expected_result: Only unquoted heredoc operators suppress following body lines.
actual_result: startsQuoted cannot distinguish an unquoted prefix from an internally quoted operator.
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-30T18:04:25.177Z",pi-agent,"Greptile 3890108579 reproduced: source-only revert made the focused regression fail because echo x'<<EOF' opened a synthetic heredoc and suppressed REAL; SOURCE_ONLY_REVERT_EXIT=1. Restored source tracks per-character quote provenance and passes map/audit regressions for joined and separated quoted operators. npm test, 100% coverage, docstring, and release:check all pass."
files[2]{path,scope}:
  scripts/shell-command-scan.ts,project
  test/verify-release-publish-attestation.test.ts,project
tests[4]{command,scope,timeout_seconds,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
