  npm run coverage,project,2400,pi-agent,"2026-08-30T18:01:58.067Z",local_mutation,pi-pr88
  npm run docstring,project,2400,pi-agent,"2026-08-30T18:01:58.067Z",local_mutation,pi-pr88
  "npm run release:check",project,2400,pi-agent,"2026-08-30T18:01:58.067Z",local_mutation,pi-pr88
close_reason: Quoted operator text no longer opens synthetic heredocs; regressions and release gates pass.
